  "description": "BACKROOMS: ESCAPE THE BRAINROT\n\nThe internet has lost its mind. And you're trapped inside.\n\nEnter a mental maze where every room is a rotten meme, every corridor an anxiety attack, and every entity a nightmare laughing at you. A blend of fear, absurdity, and disturbing brilliance that will make you scream, then laugh at how loud you're screaming.\n\nLocations you'll want to forget\n\nFaded poolrooms drowning in dead silence. Endless backrooms heavy with oppressive déjà vu. Brainrot-rooms born from the most feverish corners of the web. Every space is a visual trap.\n\nEntities that laugh at you\n\nDeformed living memes, original nightmare creatures, and brainrot icons reimagined as horror abominations. They want you dead — but first, they want to break your mind.\n\nGameplay on the edge of panic\n\nSurvive, explore, find the brainrot objects, and search for a way out. Dynamic jumpscares, eerie collectibles, cryptic notes, and secret events that change everything.\n\nFree mode\n\nWhen the story ends, unlock exploration mode: revisit every location, tweak the rules, add more monsters and more brainrot with a single click. Every run is different.\n\nYou've seen the backrooms. But you've never escaped them like this.",
